data: {"type":"tool-output-available","toolCallId":"call-1a6ee265-3493-4807-af4a-5411a9c76646","output":{"output":"Found 50 matches in 22 files\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/core-concepts.mdx:\n  86: - `src/config-schema.ts` - where the module’s configuration properties live\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/core-concepts.mdx:\n  91: - `src/config-schema.ts` - où se trouvent les propriétés de configuration du module\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/key-repositories.mdx:\n  52: By default, you'll see an active visits widget and a widget for the appointments scheduled for that day in the UI. The [configuration schema](https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/blob/main/packages/esm-home-app/src/config-schema.ts) for the home app allows developers and implementers to configure which URL to navigate the user to after they click on a search result following a patient search. By default, the user will get navigated to the patient chart. The side menu and home dashboard expose extension slots into which dashboards from the [Patient Management](/docs/key-repositories#patient-management) repo plug into. These include dashboards for Appointments, Laboratory Patient Lists, Service Queues and Wards.\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/key-repositories.mdx:\n  52: Par défaut, vous verrez un widget de visites actives et un widget pour les rendez-vous programmés pour ce jour dans l'interface utilisateur. Le [schéma de configuration](https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/blob/main/packages/esm-home-app/src/config-schema.ts) pour l'application home permet aux développeurs et aux implémenteurs de configurer quelle URL utiliser pour naviguer l'utilisateur après qu'ils cliquent sur un résultat de recherche suite à une recherche de patient. Par défaut, l'utilisateur sera dirigé vers le dossier patient. Le menu latéral et le tableau de bord d'accueil exposent des slots d'extension dans lesquels se branchent les tableaux de bord du dépôt [Patient management](/docs/key-repositories#gestion-des-patients). Ceux-ci incluent des tableaux de bord pour les Rendez-vous, les Listes de patients de laboratoire, les Files d'attente de service et les Services.\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/configuration-system.mdx:\n  283: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/configuration-system.mdx:\n  283: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/configure-o3/overview.mdx:\n  158: Per-app configuration is available in O3 via the built-in [configuration system](/docs/configuration-system). Each frontend module can define its own configuration schema in a `config-schema.ts` file inside its `src` directory. The following snippet is drawn from the Programs frontend module's config-schema:\n  160: ```tsx filename=\"src/config-schema.ts\"\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/configure-o3/overview.mdx:\n  158: La configuration par application est disponible dans O3 via le [système de configuration](/docs/configuration-system) intégré. Chaque module frontend peut définir son propre schéma de configuration dans un fichier `config-schema.ts` à l'intérieur de son répertoire `src`. L'extrait suivant est tiré du config-schema du module frontend Programs :\n  160: ```tsx filename=\"src/config-schema.ts\"\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/frontend-modules/overview.mdx:\n  62: - `config-schema.ts` - where the module's configuration properties live\n  76:         <FileTree.File name=\"config-schema.ts\" />\n  91:   - A `config-schema.ts` file that defines the module's configuration schema\n  203: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  314: - **Configuration schema** – `config-schema.ts` defines the module’s configurable options. The app shell loads and merges config at runtime, so changes here affect how implementers can tailor behavior. Learn more in the [Configuration system guide](/docs/configuration-system).\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/frontend-modules/overview.mdx:\n  55: - `config-schema.ts` - où vivent les propriétés de configuration du module\n  69:         <FileTree.File name=\"config-schema.ts\" />\n  84:   - Un fichier `config-schema.ts` qui définit le schéma de configuration du module\n  195: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  305: - **Schéma de configuration** – `config-schema.ts` définit les options configurables du module. L’app shell charge et fusionne la config au runtime, ce qui contrôle le comportement côté implémentation. Voir le [guide du système de configuration](/docs/configuration-system).\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/recipes/add-a-left-panel-to-o3.mdx:\n  132: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/recipes/add-a-left-panel-to-o3.mdx:\n  132: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/recipes/create-a-frontend-module.mdx:\n  76: - `src/config-schema.ts` defines runtime configuration.\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/recipes/create-a-frontend-module.mdx:\n  76: - `src/config-schema.ts` définit la configuration runtime.\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/migration-guides/migrate-to-core-v5.mdx:\n  36: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  122: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  449: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  529: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  610: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  648: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/migration-guides/migrate-to-core-v5.mdx:\n  37: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  374: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\" ;\n  468: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  549: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n  586: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/coding-conventions/code-organization.mdx:\n  38:   - `routes.json`, `config-schema.ts`, and lifecycle exports wired to `@openmrs/esm-framework`\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/coding-conventions/code-organization.mdx:\n  38:   - `routes.json`, `config-schema.ts` et exports de lifecycle reliés à `@openmrs/esm-framework`\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/recipes/add-links-to-the-home-page-left-panel.mdx:\n  114: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/recipes/add-links-to-the-home-page-left-panel.mdx:\n  114: import { configSchema } from \"./config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/en-US/docs/frontend-modules/unit-and-integration-testing.mdx:\n  429: import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n  438: import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n  451:   import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n  460:   import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n  477: import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n  493: import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n\n[github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs] content/fr-FR/docs/frontend-modules/unit-and-integration-testing.mdx:\n  428: import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n  437: import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n  450:   import type { PatientRegistrationConfig } from \"../config-schema\";\n\n(Output was cut short: narrow the path or pattern, name a repo, or raise the limit.)","sources":[{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/en-US/docs/core-concepts.mdx","name":"core-concepts.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/fr-FR/docs/core-concepts.mdx","name":"core-concepts.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/en-US/docs/key-repositories.mdx","name":"key-repositories.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/fr-FR/docs/key-repositories.mdx","name":"key-repositories.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/en-US/docs/configuration-system.mdx","name":"configuration-system.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/fr-FR/docs/configuration-system.mdx","name":"configuration-system.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/en-US/docs/configure-o3/overview.mdx","name":"overview.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/fr-FR/docs/configure-o3/overview.mdx","name":"overview.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/en-US/docs/frontend-modules/overview.mdx","name":"overview.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/fr-FR/docs/frontend-modules/overview.mdx","name":"overview.mdx","revision":"HEAD"},{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-o3-docs","path":"content/en-US/docs/reci