data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"I"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" have everything needed. Let me write the answer"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":".\n\n<!--answer-->\nAn O3 frontend"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" module declares its configurable settings by writing"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" a **config schema** — a plain"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" JavaScript object whose leaves describe each setting's"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" type, default and validation rules — and registering"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" it with the framework in its entry point. Implement"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"ers then override those settings by writing JSON,"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" without touching code.\n\nThe documentation lives in the O"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"3 docs repo, in `configuration-system"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":".mdx` (the developer-facing guide"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":") and `configure-o3/over"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"view.mdx` (the implementer"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"-facing guide). The implementation lives in `open"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"mrs-esm-core`, in the `@"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"openmrs/esm-config` package.\n\n## What"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" the documentation says\n\nThe config system \""}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"provides a framework for making frontend modules"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":" configurable by implementers without requiring code changes\" @"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"file:{github.com/openmrs/openmrs-cont"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"rib-o3-docs::content/en-US"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt-0","delta":"/docs/configuration-system.mdx:3"}

